                <note rend="inline" type="source">890H.001 Zahir/5: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Marriner</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-07-02T17:00:00-04:00">July 2, 1934—5 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>263. Your 493, June 30, noon. You should forward letter for the consideration of
                    the President and so inform the Afghan Minister.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
